# Clean Architecture + DDD (Next internal API)

- Feature-based modules: `src/modules/<feature>/{domain,application,infrastructure,presentation}`
- Dependency direction: `presentation -> application -> domain`; `infrastructure -> domain | application ports`
- Forbidden: domain -> outward layers; presentation -> infrastructure/repositories; Prisma outside infrastructure
- Controllers (Route Handlers) inject/use **only** use-cases via composition roots in `src/lib/di/`
- One use-case = one business operation with `execute(input)`
- Mutate use-cases wrap writes in `ITransactionManager.runInTransaction`
- Use-case must not call another use-case
- Validation schemas live in `presentation/http/validation/schemas/` (Zod)
- Request mappers: `request-body-to-*` | `request-query-params-to-*` | `request-params-to-*`
